  "about_item": [
    "Effortlessly Control Angle: This adjustable drafting table tilts from 0-65°, allows to adjust as needed. It serves both as a regular flat table for daily tasks and an art desk for artistic pursuits. Whether writing reports or diving into creative artwork, this versatile desk has you covered.",
