    "User-centred Storage Design: The drafting table with storage features two non-woven fabric drawers and a fabric storage shelf below, providing convenient storage for paper, drawing tools, and other items, with pencil box on the right side. When the tabletop tilts, the pencil rack ensures that pencils and other drawing tools do not roll off, and this artist desk includes separate slots for various drawing utensils.",
    "Drafting Table Desk Combo: This architect's drafting desk comes with a 20-inch high drawing stool. The stool features a sturdy structure, refined metal frame, and matches the color and style of the art desk for adults. Its seat is covered in black PU material with a foam cushion, offering a comfortable seating experience.",
    "Drafting Table with Drawers Dimensions: 40.2\"(L) x23.7\"(W)x29.5\" (H). Stool: 15.8\"(L) x11.8\"(W)x20\" (H). Max Weight Capacity: Tabletop: 55 lb; Stool: 220 lb."
  ],
